sn35.18:1.8 | P: gandhānaṁ … | T: (none)
sn35.18:1.9 | P: rasānaṁ … | T: (none)
sn35.18:1.10 | P: phoṭṭhabbānaṁ … | T: (none)
sn35.18:1.11 | P: dhammānaṁ assādo abhavissa, nayidaṁ sattā dhammesu sārajjeyyuṁ. | T: (none)
