sn35.20:2.6 | P: phoṭṭhabbe … | T: “Whoever doesn’t delight in tactile sensations doesn’t delight in stress…
sn35.20:2.7 | P: dhamme nābhinandati, dukkhaṁ so nābhinandati. | T: “Monks, whoever doesn’t delight in ideas doesn’t delight in stress.
