sn35.234:5.3 | P: “Yo cāvuso, hetu yo ca paccayo jivhāviññāṇassa uppādāya, so ca hetu, so ca paccayo sabbena sabbaṁ sabbathā sabbaṁ aparisesaṁ nirujjheyya, api nu kho jivhāviññāṇaṁ paññāyethā”ti? | T: (none)
sn35.234:5.4 | P: “No hetaṁ, āvuso”. | T: (none)
